        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.14.1+ROM.14.2+ROM.14.3+ROM.14.4+ROM.14.5+ROM.14.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 14.1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nuko rero ntihakagire ubacira urubanza ku bw'ibyo murya cyangwa ibyo munywa, cyangwa ku bw'iminsi mikuru, cyangwa ku bwo kuziririza imboneko z'ukwezi, cyangwa amasabato ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kuko ibyo ari igicucu cy'ibizaba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "igicucu cy'ibizaba:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "cyangwa, ibisūra ibizaba.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " naho umubiri wabyo ufitwe na Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntihakagire umuntu ubavutsa ingororano zanyu, azibavukishije kwihindura nk'uwicisha bugufi no gusenga abamarayika, akiterera mu byo atazi atewe kwihimbariza ubusa n'ubwenge bwa kamere ye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.4.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ef 4.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ntiyifatanye na wa Mutwe, ari wo umubiri wose uvanaho gukura kwawo gutangwa n'Imana, ugatungwa n'ibyo ingingo n'imitsi bitanga, ugateranywa neza na byo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero niba mwarapfanye na Kristo, mukaba mwarapfuye ku migenzereze ya mbere y'iby'isi, ni iki gituma mwemera kuyoboka amategeko y'imihango nk'aho mukiri ab'isi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(ngo “Ntugafateho, ntugasogongereho, ntugakoreho”, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi ibyo byose biba biheze iyo biriwe), mugakurikiza amategeko n'inyigisho by'abantu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni koko ibyo bisa n'aho ari iby'ubwenge kugira ngo abantu bihimbire uburyo bwo gusenga, bigire nk'abicisha bugufi, bigomwe iby'umubiri. Nyamara nta mumaro bigira na hato wo kurwanya irari ry'umubiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
